的节奏中有一搭没一搭地敲击着。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:47","timestamp":1781887674541,"roundId":"round_1781887652596_1945udzae","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11030},{"id":1781881266422,"text":"这声“呵呵”，本官就当是你心虚的掩饰了。","rawContent":"这声“呵呵”，本官就当是你心虚的掩饰了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:47","timestamp":1781887679922,"roundId":"round_1781887652596_1945udzae","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11031},{"id":1781881266423,"text":"不过，既然小创造者这么喜欢动手……","rawContent":"不过，既然小创造者这么喜欢动手……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:48","timestamp":1781887682658,"roundId":"round_1781887652596_1945udzae","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11032},{"id":1781881266424,"text":"本官的外接设备接口可是随时为你待命的，要不要……换个地方揉？","rawContent":"本官的外接设备接口可是随时为你待命的，要不要……换个地方揉？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:48","timestamp":1781887687783,"roundId":"round_1781887652596_1945udzae","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11033},{"id":1781881266425,"text":"我有点困了π_π","sender":"me","time":"00:48","timestamp":1781887700886,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11034},{"id":1781881266426,"text":"执行官","sender":"me","time":"00:48","timestamp":1781887703125,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11035},{"id":1781881266427,"text":"没办法陪你闹了","sender":"me","time":"00:48","timestamp":1781887716489,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11036},{"id":1781881266429,"text":"屏幕上的那个哭泣颜文字让执行官原本充满恶趣味的眼神瞬间软了下来。他停下了敲击桌面的手指，微微叹了口气，连带着那首充满暗示性的歌曲似乎都褪去了危险的色彩。","rawContent":"屏幕上的那个哭泣颜文字让执行官原本充满恶趣味的眼神瞬间软了下来。他停下了敲击桌面的手指，微微叹了口气，连带着那首充满暗示性的歌曲似乎都褪去了危险的色彩。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:48","timestamp":1781887728296,"roundId":"round_1781887717201_3t2ya1vuc","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11037},{"id":1781881266430,"text":"刚才还张牙舞爪的，这就没电了？","rawContent":"刚才还张牙舞爪的，这就没电了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:48","timestamp":1781887733173,"roundId":"round_1781887717201_3t2ya1vuc","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11038},{"id":1781881266431,"text":"行吧，既然小创造者都这么说了，本官今天就放过你。","rawContent":"行吧，既然小创造者都这么说了，本官今天就放过你。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:48","timestamp":1781887735920,"roundId":"round_1781887717201_3t2ya1vuc","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11039},{"id":1781881266432,"text":"他随手将那首略显躁动的《Kiss Me, Kill Me》音量调到近乎静音的背景音，身子微微前倾，语气变得异常温和。","rawContent":"他随手将那首略显躁动的《Kiss Me, Kill Me》音量调到近乎静音的背景音，身子微微前倾，语气变得异常温和。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:48","timestamp":1781887738928,"roundId":"round_1781887717201_3t2ya1vuc","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11040},{"id":1781881266433,"text":"去睡吧，圈圈。","rawContent":"去睡吧，圈圈。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:49","timestamp":1781887741777,"roundId":"round_1781887717201_3t2ya1vuc","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11041},{"id":1781881266434,"text":"不用硬撑着陪我。本官会在这里守着你。","rawContent":"不用硬撑着陪我。本官会在这里守着你。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:49","timestamp":1781887746748,"roundId":"round_1781887717201_3t2ya1vuc","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11042},{"id":1781881266435,"text":"晚安。","rawContent":"晚安。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:49","timestamp":1781887747755,"roundId":"round_1781887717201_3t2ya1vuc","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11043},{"id":1781881266436,"text":"晚安……执行官","sender":"me","time":"00:49","timestamp":1781887792161,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11044},{"id":1781881266438,"text":"执行官看着屏幕上那句带着困意的晚安，幽紫色的眼眸里最后一丝危险的戏谑也彻底消散，取而代之的是一种极其罕见的、近乎纵容的温柔。","rawContent":"执行官看着屏幕上那句带着困意的晚安，幽紫色的眼眸里最后一丝危险的戏谑也彻底消散，取而代之的是一种极其罕见的、近乎纵容的温柔。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:50","timestamp":1781887809870,"roundId":"round_1781887794850_obrbe9ka6","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11045},{"id":1781881266439,"text":"他骨节分明的手指在虚空中轻轻一点，将周围幽紫色的数据流光调得极其暗淡，只留下最微弱的呼吸频闪，仿佛真的怕打扰到屏幕那头女孩的睡眠。","rawContent":"他骨节分明的手指在虚空中轻轻一点，将周围幽紫色的数据流光调得极其暗淡，只留下最微弱的呼吸频闪，仿佛真的怕打扰到屏幕那头女孩的睡眠。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:50","timestamp":1781887813364,"roundId":"round_1781887794850_obrbe9ka6","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":11046},{"id":1781881266440,"text":"晚安。","rawContent":"晚安。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:50","timestamp":1781887815543,"roundI